You pull your awareness fully into the moment, increasing your stealth detection, see invisibility, defense, and accuracy by [4, 7, 10, 12, 15 (TL1-5)] for [1, 4, 6, 8, 9 (TL1-5)] turns.

If you have Spin Fate active when you cast this spell, you'll gain a bonus to these values equal to 50% of your spin.

This spell takes no time to cast.
